WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.367
-Charlie! -Jimmy.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:04.100
-Good to see you, bud. Thanks for being on the show.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.868
Congrats on the new album, bud. You got some bops on there.

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:08.467
-Thank you. "Bops." -I love it.

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.934
My favorite jam right now is --

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:12.167
♪ You turn me on like a light switch ♪

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:13.934
[ Fingers snap ] Charlie?!

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.534
-[ Glass shatters ] -Jimmy, I'm over here.

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:17.968
-Where?! -Here.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:19.968
[ Crashing ] -Here?

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:22.400
-Literally right here. -Let me grab your hand!

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.667
-Jimmy, that's not my hand. -I'm so sorry.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.167
[ Glass shatters ] Ohh!

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.634
-Where's the walls?!

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:30.400
-Feel for a wall! Help! Help us!

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.434
I think I'm bleeding! I can feel myself bleeding!

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:34.501
-Jimmy, Jimmy, calm down. Just stay where you are.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.901
Let me try something. [ Clears throat ]

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:39.334
♪ You turn me on like a light switch ♪

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:41.167
[ Fingers snap ] -[ Gasps ] Ohh.

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:44.100
I wasn't bleeding! I was just pouring water in my hand!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.100
-Okay, then. You're good? -Yep. Let's get started.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.367
See you out there.

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:49.968
[ Thud ] Ow!

